# steps/table-receiver.md §8 (was slice 2's refusal "primitive.lm2: cannot read a table file of the
# translator"): a program that asks no primitive question (its whole body is the letter to the host) and has
# no `primitive.description` among its source tables (harness Primitive = absent) needs none -- it
# translates and runs: Entry 7.  One that asks is refused at the question (unit_s7_prim_table_nodesc).

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
